00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:53.080
You okay, Satonaka?

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:54.350
That's-!

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:56.320
No, stay back!

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:57.890
Don't look!

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:01.320
No... No, this isn't...

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:02.890
Satonaka!

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:03.920
Moron!

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:15.770
Damn it! There's so many!

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:20.300
No, you're wrong...

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:25.510
Are you gonna continue to suppress me,
pretending I don't exist?

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:26.820
Shut up!

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:29.220
You aren't... You aren't!

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:30.720
Satonaka!

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:33.380
You aren't me!

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:45.590
I am a Shadow, the true self...

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:49.670
Oh no, no, no!

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:51.200
Satonaka!

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:58.950
Don't get in my way!

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:06.150
I see, so you're gonna pester me too.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.880
Then I better teach you a lesson!

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:12.690
Master, you're beariffic!

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:18.960
Hanamura!

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.570
You're still there?

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:29.800
Bite the dust already!

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:33.950
I'll be sure to take good care of Yukiko...

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:35.540
...as my foot stool!

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:38.110
A stool?

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:43.090
Really, I'm the one who can't do
anything on my own.

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:45.630
I'm so pathetic.

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:48.820
But Yukiko actually needs me.

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:51.400
That's why she's my friend.

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.020
I can't lose her!

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:55.470
No, I don't...

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:58.510
Satonaka, don't let her trick you!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:17:59.560
Silence!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.010
Hanamura!

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:04.600
I'm not trying to trick her.

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:06.810
These are my true colors.

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.780
My true colors!

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:14.690
Yukiko's so pretty.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:18.420
The boys go wild over her.

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:19.690
They're me?

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:25.190
Right, they're how you feel deep down inside:

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:27.790
jealous and envious.

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:32.870
Without me around, she can't do anything.

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:36.410
She'd be nothing without me!

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:38.780
No... No!

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:41.510
No!

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:50.020
These are my true colors?

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.320
How horrible...

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:55.750
Who cares if it is?

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:59.060
You're still her friend, aren't you?

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:05.540
Yukiko!

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:07.830
They're right, Yukiko!

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:11.580
We're friends, aren't we?

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:17.250
You're the inner "me" that
I pretended never existed.

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:24.480
You're the pathetic part of me.

00:19:24.860 --> 00:19:28.490
But that's still me, isn't it?

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.430
Satonaka!

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.430
Cut the crap!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:38.400
Are you seriously gonna acknowledge
my existence and accept me?!

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:42.940
Narukami!

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:44.910
D... damn you!

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:52.650
I'm going to tear you to pieces!

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:54.120
Hanamura!

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:56.180
Oh, dear! Yosuke!

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:58.530
Hanamura!

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:03.050
Your bonds have allowed you
to obtain a new Arcana.

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:08.060
You possess the power
to wield multiple Personas.

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:10.230
It is the Wild Card,

00:20:10.340 --> 00:20:12.270
O Chosen One.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:17.070
Chosen One?

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:19.400
Change!

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:23.380
Pyro Jack!

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:34.590
Oh, my, my!

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:39.070
N... no fair! He gets to use two Personas?

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:39.860
Get her!

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:46.840
Hanamura!

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:47.670
Yeah!

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:11.230
You are me...

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:38.890
What's this?

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:40.930
A Persona.

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:43.230
So this is my?

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:44.530
Yep.

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:49.490
It's my Persona...

00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:00.980
Yeah, that's right. Yep.

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:03.180
He looks busy.

00:22:04.290 --> 00:22:05.950
I'm so lame.

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:10.960
Yukiko could die the next time
it gets foggy here,

00:22:10.960 --> 00:22:13.650
but my body gave out on me.

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:14.960
I can't stand it!

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:17.120
You aren't lame.

00:22:18.200 --> 00:22:22.570
I'm certain we will need your help
if we're going to save Amagi.

00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:25.240
Thank you!

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:27.710
As thanks I'll show ya something special.

00:22:28.040 --> 00:22:29.340
What's that?

00:22:29.340 --> 00:22:30.940
It's my dog.

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:35.180
He's a fatso and stinks to high heavens...

00:22:37.150 --> 00:22:45.420
...but he paved the way and introduced me
to my dear friend, Yukiko.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.790
Yukiko...

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:54.670
no time to waste

00:22:54.670 --> 00:22:55.200
but make you pace

00:22:55.200 --> 00:22:57.140
it's OK to remove copy and paste

00:22:57.140 --> 00:22:58.070
I'm doing my way

00:22:58.070 --> 00:22:59.010
you do it your way

00:22:59.010 --> 00:23:00.680
don't just follow your left find the right way

00:23:00.680 --> 00:23:01.380
stereotypes

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:02.240
too many hypes

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:04.080
but I'm the epitome of new types

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:05.750
having the fear is power to my soul

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:06.750
cuz I overcome them

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:07.520
that's how I roll

00:23:07.520 --> 00:23:09.120
expose your thoughts

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:12.650
don't be afraid of making mistakes

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:15.180
rules prevailing in

00:23:15.520 --> 00:23:19.860
that may be your greatest rival

00:23:21.360 --> 00:23:24.870
believe in faith and your heart

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:27.940
your true soul stop being

00:23:27.940 --> 00:23:30.570
in the shades come on

00:23:30.570 --> 00:23:33.970
out in the open sun

00:23:34.610 --> 00:23:40.010
Beauty of the child of destiny

00:23:41.350 --> 00:23:43.420
delightful days

00:23:43.420 --> 00:23:48.520
are with rich density of love

00:23:48.520 --> 00:23:50.120
thorny path

00:23:50.930 --> 00:23:55.390
there's no easy way for real bliss

00:23:55.730 --> 00:23:58.570
so I keep on fighting for

00:23:58.570 --> 00:24:03.370
beauty of destiny

00:24:18.590 --> 00:24:19.450
Chie!

00:24:19.690 --> 00:24:20.990
Don't get in my way!

00:24:20.990 --> 00:24:22.120
C'mon, pal!

00:24:22.120 --> 00:24:23.320
Yeah, let's do it!

00:24:23.320 --> 00:24:25.130
Was that from back then?

00:24:25.130 --> 00:24:26.260
I won't run away.

00:24:26.260 --> 00:24:30.060
I'm sick of those damn chains!
